{
  "id": "628ea7936db60e2d5b0b1dd3",
  "title": "快打旋风3",
  "summary": "这次选个直截了当的游戏清清脑子。 作为卡婊清版动作类的开山鼻祖，《快打旋风》 除了初代在各个平台疯狂炒冷饭以外，更多的是利用了角色的剩余价值。哈格、艾迪科迪、凯，乃至敌方角色苏杜姆、罗兰多、艾迪、毒药、安德鲁都在另外的卡普空宇宙中疯狂出场，但自身的正宗续作《快打旋风2》《快打旋风3》的自身水准和外部评价都不太高。3代比2代强一点。 这次玩的3代，在系统上对比1代其实改进非常多：加入了搓招、跑动攻击、超必杀，流畅性对比难度贼高的1代提升很大。但要说多好玩呢，也并没有。3代是超任独占的，家用机的性能决定了同屏敌人最多4个，再难能难哪去？倒是我选的露西亚贫攻，常常出现因时间不够而引起的恐慌。 本来我玩游戏都是首选日版，其次美版。但这个游戏强烈推荐欧版。按住SELECT进入标题画面，后面就谁用谁知道了。 搓招意义不太…",
  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/837001b3db7db9aafe23f7cfd69bd153dc3ca555d46f71a939d62dbdd2d3165465e6020fe32330977b553377207f5261c552e2a2d2d527ad67273873c1707a79c2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">快打旋风3</a></p>\n<p>这次选个直截了当的游戏清清脑子。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/ca2d416056a0a60812efbcddf60d5dec2f89d4732a415635ae3591eac60527c4b64f4de34f5a52997f1da5a7003eae5c2e88e20f55d9975c2496481df0e533145fb7288931dce0321a47a2c37bd0eb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_043\"></a></p>\n<p>作为卡婊清版动作类的开山鼻祖，《快打旋风》<sup><a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/f00770f0a2acecf428a63f6e409e5ba9897a02c3fa14a95faff21fba7930eefed49586a20058f282db51b6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">[2]</a></sup> 除了初代在各个平台疯狂炒冷饭以外，更多的是利用了角色的剩余价值。哈格、<del>艾迪</del>科迪、凯，乃至敌方角色苏杜姆、罗兰多、艾迪、毒药、安德鲁都在另外的卡普空宇宙中疯狂出场，但自身的正宗续作《快打旋风2》《快打旋风3》的自身水准和外部评价都不太高。3代比2代强一点。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/d88ace966c055450c091c6a66c1907187850d7ec9153ebab34277677898cc93e725b037e220d8d80278ba604971fff6b01a6f0d9c4e6d6caad3c4cd19b15d7e883d6421f44e586639d81503fd619bd\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_000\"></a></p>\n<p>这次玩的3代，在系统上对比1代其实改进非常多：加入了搓招、跑动攻击、超必杀，流畅性对比难度贼高的1代提升很大。但要说多好玩呢，也并没有。3代是超任独占的，家用机的性能决定了同屏敌人最多4个，再难能难哪去？倒是我选的露西亚贫攻，常常出现因时间不够而引起的恐慌。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/8e998aacd9c80f9db909292c1b766f634d88227acd7a1725c428254665a70bbde2798f67254823a651cae875e7409a3ff0241482a8cbd4b5db64638e73afca5306df89dd47835aaafaa48a2949dcb8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_014\"></a></p>\n<p>本来我玩游戏都是首选日版，其次美版。但这个游戏强烈推荐欧版。按住SELECT进入标题画面，后面就谁用谁知道了。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/89d36716fdd8a7fb66013e04f6a34b3310ebaebc2175c75d6f8816fbf04845237c30d7f1ad23c8d90ca47837c8ab9a26469d1307c69f377aebbedfad0c92057a26a38a40cb7316d0e7147e3c6e5d3b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_008\"></a></p>\n<p>搓招意义不太大，起码对于女主露西亚是这样。升龙腿收招破绽极大，除了耍帅，就只有落地挨揍的用处。而那个SUPER气槽存在的时间又短，BOSS战时难以抓住时机，也是只能装B用。最实用的还是跑动攻击，手速够的话能把敌人连到死，也挺爽。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/52e9b6dcfc25ea37acaa2660575d237d5117884907384aba53b7ed692bf9ccc880aa68bd0534a0194612166ca47a722319d3aaa84a864bacac9e515748f8c37ddeef273136b05602936d12e50a69d5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_003\"></a></p>\n<p>清版动作最重要的还是那说不清道不明的打击感。本作这方面还行，但从出品时间来看，比对面的格斗四人组系列还是稍逊一筹。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/99e5a8a2ecf21f6223cfc95c7ab84d3a09440ffed0c3c136a036daf7de87c7477f61f9fd33bd67ee0a71d104cf7a8209aed9658d8356dc5c20c3650c2f27b98821c2cc318795caaaa306493eab3400\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_028\"></a></p>\n<p>分支路线算特色吗？在1995年这个时间点看来不算，只能算“借鉴”来的。但某些路线可以跳过BOSS，也是挺值得的。有一条不太容易出现的路线是唐人街，场景设计还是挺赞的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/cd815aa8be1479942a1d35b5942e33eec9f28270eeb370d3f559fdbfbcf19ce61d140d18f2c208286350892a16dae011d1b0d8b7b5c72256ddd879646dea7370c79d8cb253745ca361f8cb8ecf2850\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_030\"></a></p>\n<p>只是这一关的BOSS嘛，有点刻板印象了。这只BOSS会点穴嘿！<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/2d870bc48dce3e7eaa307e6a374bd071ad358e9aac70104f1acc9424b9fb15b0572501d04533b3b4cfc69b18fbde5fbfb03ea80fd026b9a7d33402abc09056fb0c89d4c45da794bea4a2d15961486f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_063\"></a></p>\n<p>其余的BOSS们。只打一遍可是会认不全的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/618d0c1ae50a079c6d9d255fdd4b6645497539aa21e28b3aeaa3ed7536ba81ab6754178d37c39f19e39c44826f86ced6673c89edf5ee36d7c88cb269951aaf7220a12a1d1ada2a59c76ca0a2c92d2a\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_006\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/38dc6907c0c1c756a7d08383626df4b6b3ed5336668d8b7cb4e35cedc33468bf8863197445689105100477d430cd97ff235b82d36332c9975c5b9814f6c31f72cbffed6e045c28abe5275b7ae0078e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_010\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/5ed6b2cb687b3d8034a38b0c5c57dc34748644452d3209bf68e38aee9c4de7f1f82db69340c621a97525c3ee75d5141c4f9754b8c937db24370524352d3bced2d8f4d767f7ed54573079c540e6bbfe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_048\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/c8c6108cf2287c048e43b8f8f222b5dde2aa16fbd53e1f17333e81430d9fb11695ee9de9666e3a383fb9cf3195ce06f960b6730225e9c94f6a3edc0dbb54832674da3f5c0717d27518a364edaf9436\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_012\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/5a372d239c96a8f023e47c78d04a41395b1f0b6701c25fc04678a8663f67524abc280024721c1f1d5989b8f9d1874afd863c95d4a4fc75b37ce5a7337740c7baec1994796507a3acb9c3e48cabe4b0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_019\"></a></p>\n<p>最终BOSS，只要不被抓住，不难。最后死在电网上，哪怕不是在电网这侧打死的，也会强行漂移过去。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/bf66cef06435f31a0cf6f3012ca66e1f286f2eb5e05631c7dbe83d01b4ccb6f88e9d69390a79b5747b0784b2fc94e5e8c70e654d165100df623885635bc30967fd96a1229448a937d5ce132f4ab52c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_023\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/976020a7930dad9cb49debb1bc23894a7b692b9b26d83fb6def8f58b32950da13716fe80770eb4eacc0e83b36930abc467aa4ec1b3c3ceb40b7dc02f0e21779b878df4ef516711059fbd3cf67adc87\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_025\"></a></p>\n<p>通关画面，明显男主角金毛的迪恩跟另外三个尿不到一个坑里。迪恩在卡普空后续的其它游戏里再没出现过。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/b42a9cf37b832df6a08aa50d7f4ee1c41d5e1b6745cb68dde989d2bf172379b897a339c5d271ccfb2392fccf0a154a34d2d61acc21ecaaabc8438db210cb21f5a0a68ebd125a804e084c5df5ea9eac\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_031\"></a></p>\n<p>选最高难度才能出现真正的结局，也就是“END”这三个字。不值！<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/6871bbcda6b56ee7cf7e8a892950d5d910fed442458cb33c711e70bf09ac92c848dcc30cbd59078764bcfd3ef9b06fd2c734c701d17d3255a09c0e60a5c7fc682be4fa8831a9f5d456feba411a6e63\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_033\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/fe0d5e437025e2e28cdf40e847d6a656a1db7428f2faa98d01bbfc35b0aba9cd457a700431546622af9311542468529284a7ed967a8b6cedc9acaba74e4d7f5197a67243c9788f70a8341f02addd99\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_032\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">(1)</a>：别问为啥用千问，问就是88VIP快到期了，不愿意多注册国产服务。</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">(2)</a>：Street Fighter = 陆港街头霸王=台快打旋风，Final Fight = 陆港快打旋风 = 台街头快打</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div><span>《<a href=\"https://pewae.com/2026/10/final-fight-3.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">快打旋风3</a>》采用<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">署名-非商业性使用-禁止演绎</a>许可协议进行许可。 『<a href=\"https://pewae.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">破袜子</a>』期待与您交流。</span><div><div><h3>相关推荐:</h3><ul><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2022/11/darkwing-duck.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">狡猾飞天德</a><span>[53%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2022/08/ninja-ryuuken-den-tomoe.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">忍者龙剑传：巴</a><span>[51%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2024/03/tenchi-o-kurau-ii-shokatsu-koumei-den.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">吞食天地2：诸葛孔明传</a><span>[40%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2024/09/mega-man-3.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">洛克人3</a><span>[40%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2019/05/e-v-o-search-of-enden.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">46亿年物语</a><span>[38%]</span></li></ul></div></div></div>",
